{"4626170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LISIA", "steam_appid": 4626170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4808460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>LISIA Corporation Welcome Letter</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dear employee</i>, the main <strong>road is destroyed!</strong> You will have to take a detour. Don't worry, it's perfectly drivable; the route is just a bit... challenging. In any case, you can always use winches or build the road yourself. Several of our employees have already set out on this route — <strong>follow them and deliver the cargo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you in the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op:</strong> Complete the entire journey alone or team up with friends.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics:</strong> Haul massive boulders with your winch or your own hands! The road won't build itself.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winch System:</strong> Use front and rear winches to pull teammates out of the abyss, <span class=\"bb_strike\">drag them down with you</span> or scale steep cliffs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creativity:</strong> A full body-paint system. Use a spray can to create a unique style for your truck. Remember — you are liable for any damage to corporate property.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Variety:</strong> The path to the summit crosses several unique biomes — from rocky terrains to snowy peaks. Only the most disciplined employees can make it this far.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Price of Failure:</strong> One wrong move can cost you your life. Be careful on narrow sections and remember: you are expected at home.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Lobby:</strong> Watch your videos on a huge TV, shoot hoops, paint your trucks, and just have a good time! LISIA cares about you!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>LISIA Corporation Welcome Letter</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dear employee</i>, the main <strong>road is destroyed!</strong> You will have to take a detour. Don't worry, it's perfectly drivable; the route is just a bit... challenging. In any case, you can always use winches or build the road yourself. Several of our employees have already set out on this route — <strong>follow them and deliver the cargo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you in the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op:</strong> Complete the entire journey alone or team up with friends.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics:</strong> Haul massive boulders with your winch or your own hands! The road won't build itself.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winch System:</strong> Use front and rear winches to pull teammates out of the abyss, <span class=\"bb_strike\">drag them down with you</span> or scale steep cliffs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creativity:</strong> A full body-paint system. Use a spray can to create a unique style for your truck. Remember — you are liable for any damage to corporate property.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Variety:</strong> The path to the summit crosses several unique biomes — from rocky terrains to snowy peaks. Only the most disciplined employees can make it this far.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Price of Failure:</strong> One wrong move can cost 